# HP50g storage E2E launch through the original UI and ARMToolbox.
# ZZHPDIR is present in the run-phase VVFAT root, so File Manager starts on
# that directory. Move down through the volume label and HPCLANG.TST to select
# HPCLANG.HP before following the normal copy/RCL/ARMToolbox choreography.
# Copy HPCLANG.HP from SD to HOME, recall the native object from File Manager,
# return to the stack with HALT, then follow the hardware-verified library menu:
# RS+LIB exposes ARMTo on F1, and ARMTo exposes PrRUN on F1.
2000 chord lshift files
4200 capture files
4500 tap up
4800 tap f6
6500 capture sd
6900 tap enter
7200 tap down
7500 tap down
7800 tap down
8200 capture sd-payload
8500 tap f2
9700 capture copy-destination
10000 tap down
10300 tap f6
12100 capture copy-result
12600 tap f4
13900 capture recalled-in-filer
14400 tap nxt
15100 tap nxt
16000 capture filer-halt-menu
16400 tap f1
17700 capture payload-recalled
19000 chord rshift two
20300 capture lib
20700 tap f1
22000 capture armtoolbox
22200 monitor 20000
22400 tap f1
